ENTRY            M1068   20260703   20260928   20260928       M147
SUBENT        M1068001   20260703   20260928   20260928       M147
BIB                  9         28
TITLE      New data on the photodisintegration of the rhenium
            isotope 187Re.
AUTHOR     (V.V.Varlamov,A.I.Davydov,V.N.Orlin)
REFERENCE  (J,PAN,89,133,2026) Engl. transl. of  YF,89,77,2026.
           #doi:10.1134/S1063778826600351
           (J,YF,89,77,2026)
INSTITUTE  (4RUSMOS)
INC-SOURCE (BRST)
ANALYSIS   The unpublished data for cross sections of partial
            reactions (g,1n) and (g,2n) were obtained using
            published cross sections of reactions:
                SIG(g,xn) = SIG(g,sn) + 2SIG(g,2n) and
                SIG(g,sn) = SIG(g,sn) + SIG(g,2n)
           The cross sections of both partial reactions (g,1n)
            and (g,2n) were evaluated using the experimental
            photoneutron yield cross section (g,xn) = (g,1n)+
            2(g,2n) and the objective physical criteria of data
            reliability, ratios
                       Fi-theor = SIG(g,in)/SIG(g,xn).
            Using  these ratios calculated in  the  combined
            photonuclear reaction model new evaluated data for
            partial reaction cross sections
                 SIG-eval(g,in) = Fi-theor x SIG-exp(g,xn)
            were evaluated for i = 1 and 2.
ERR-ANALYS (DATA-ERR) Mean-root-squared uncertainties.
STATUS     (APRVD) By V.Varlamov.
HISTORY    (20260703C) Data were compiled at the Russia MSU SINP
            CDFE by V.Varlamov.
ENDBIB              28
NOCOMMON             0          0
ENDSUBENT           31
SUBENT        M1068002   20260703   20260928   20260928       M147
