REACTION   (75-RE-187(G,2N)75-RE-185,,SIG,,,DEROT)
ANALYSIS   The unpublished cross section of partial reaction
            (g,2n) was obtained using the difference between
            published cross sections of reactions:
                  SIG(g,2n) = SIG(g,xn) - SIG(g,sn).
REL-REF    (R,M0645001,A.M.Goryachev+,J,SNP,17,236,1974)
            Published cross sections.
STATUS     (DEP,M0645004)
            Published neutron yield cross-section
            SIG(g,xn) = SIG(g,sn) + 2SIG(g,2n).
           (DEP,M0645009)
            Published cross-section of total photoneutron
            reaction
            SIG(g,sn) = SIG(g,1n) + SIG(g,2n).
           (TABLE,,V.V.Varlamov+,J,PAN,89,133,2026)
            Data plotted in Fig. 1 (triangles).
ENDBIB              16
